{"id":1101,"chapter_id":1,"scene_id":114,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"滴——滴——滴——滴——","style":3,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"选项","options":["……海拉？赫卡蒂……？"],"jump":[3],"style":6,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"？？","content":"…………有反应了……EEG很活跃……","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"？？","content":"……好，18号位降低频率到0.7，精确记录……","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"？？","content":"……结构稳定……记忆损伤…………生理没有异常……","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"选项","content":"我在……哪儿？|你们是谁……？","options":["我在……哪儿？","你们是谁……？"],"jump":[7,7],"style":6,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"？？","content":"有点杂音……加抑制……M值怎么样了？有危险吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"？？","content":"…………没有波动？……确定不是测量精度的问题？","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"？？","content":"……………这不可能……他接触了那么多狂厄者……","female_content":"……………这不可能……她接触了那么多狂厄者……","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101009","vo_cgplot_1101009f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"？？","content":"……那两个禁闭者怎么样……","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"选项","content":"她们……？你对她们做了什么？","options":["你对她们做了什么？"],"jump":[13,13],"style":6,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"？？","content":"……加抑制……","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101012"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"？？","content":"……是吗……她们也……闹得那么厉害，却还很稳定……","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"？？","content":"…………是管理局的技术吗……还是说这个人…………","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"？？","content":"呵呵………………要好好研究一下了……我有预感，他会是关键……","female_content":"呵呵………………要好好研究一下了……我有预感，她会是关键……","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101015","vo_cgplot_1101015f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"？？","content":"……跟<color=#fb9259>她</color>一起…………看看……有……什么……变……化…………","voice":["vo_cgplot_1101016"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"破旧凌乱的空间，空气中飘动着浮尘，和一股混杂着血腥、腐臭的消毒水的味道。","style":3,"background":104,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"content":"忙乱的人声和哭嚎声都隔着一层阻碍，虽然凄厉，但还有些遥远。","style":3,"background":104,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"你尝试感知了一下自身——没有疼痛，也没有被束缚。你还没被怎么样，松了一口气。","style":3,"background":104,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"content":"那些围在你四周的人已经散去了。","style":3,"background":104,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"content":"海拉跟赫卡蒂不在，但你能感到她们就在附近。","style":3,"background":104,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"选项","options":["去找她们"],"jump":[26],"style":6,"background":104,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"content":"你尝试支起身，可刚偏过头，映入眼帘的是——","style":3,"background":104,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"灰色的长发，苍白的脸庞，包扎在弹孔处的绷带。","style":3,"background":50107,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"content":"你认得她，你不会忘记这张毫无生气的脸。生命受到威胁的记忆突然被唤醒，你出了一身冷汗。","style":3,"background":50107,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"——那个一度要置你于死地的人，转过头，看向你。","style":3,"background":50108,"log_type":1}]}